{"id":"ocho","lemma":"ocho","pos":"noun","rank":629,"glosses":["eight","figure of eight (knot)","butthole; anus"],"ipa":"/ˈot͡ʃo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ochos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ocho.wav","examples":[{"text":"Su hijo tiene ocho años.","en":"His son is eight years old.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38314","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"son"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"year","l":"año"}]},{"text":"Suelo dormir ocho horas.","en":"I usually sleep eight hours.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/415901","words":[{"g":"dirt"},{"g":"to sleep"},null,{"g":"hour","l":"hora"}]},{"text":"Él trabaja ocho horas al día.","en":"He works eight hours a day.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639252","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to work","l":"trabajar"},null,{"g":"hour","l":"hora"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"per day"]]},{"text":"Cuatro por dos son ocho.","en":"Four multiplied by two is eight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645288","words":[{"g":"a four-stringed guitar…"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Ayer estuve trabajando más de ocho horas.","en":"I worked more than eight hours yesterday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527498","words":[{"g":"yesterday"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to work","l":"trabajar"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"hour","l":"hora"}]}]}